From 66ccce8ebdc0c9811d7a177d911d31a253dea9ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexey Evlampiev <11870299+AlexeyEvlampiev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:40:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Client::transaction_status

Exposes the transaction status from the most recent ReadyForQuery message,
so callers can tell whether a simple query or batch left the session idle,
in a transaction block, or in a failed one.
